@host = https://localhost:7060
@token = BURAYA_LOGIN_DEN_GELEN_TOKEN

### Kayıt ol (otomatik token döner)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kullanici@test.com",
  "password": "Password1!",
  "fullName": "Test Kullanıcı"
}

### Giriş yap (seed admin: admin@kiraathane.local / Admin123!)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@kiraathane.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Ürün listele (sayfalı, anonim)
GET {{host}}/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&search=

### Ürün oluştur (token gerekli)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Örnek Ürün",
  "description": "Açıklama",
  "price": 99.90,
  "stockQuantity": 25
}

### Tek ürün getir
GET {{host}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Ürün güncelle (token gerekli)
PUT {{host}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "name": "Güncel Ürün",
  "description": "Yeni açıklama",
  "price": 149.90,
  "stockQuantity": 10
}

### Ürün sil (yalnızca Admin)
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
